id: pm-slack-standup-packed-timing
title: Investigate packed npm and Bun acceptance exceeding the unchanged local timeout under shared load
description: "Direct source npm release validation on the toolchain bump ran 287 tests: 285 passed, and the two real packed acceptance matrices exceeded their existing 290000 ms subprocess timeout. The matrices cover npm-current, bun-current, npm-minimum, bun-minimum and npm-global-current. Earlier branch CI completed the same matrices and reached only the separate changelog drift. Preserve timeout and coverage thresholds; distinguish host contention or install cost from package regressions. Validation evidence is on pm-slack-standup-jnje."
