  "2026-10-26T19:08:31.471Z",codex-agent,"Standalone acceptance completed all five scenarios with matching SDK identities, rendered fixture counts and no missing fixture data. Full npm and Bun gates each passed 285/287 tests and timed out only their two instrumented real-install matrices. This separates functional acceptance from the unchanged 290000 ms budget; investigate instrumentation, fresh per-scenario caches and shared scheduling without lowering coverage or increasing that timeout."
